# ─── EXTENDED 2026-06-12: drop build-only giant JSON tanks from the deploy ───
# ~115MB of top-level data tanks read ONLY by local build scripts in scripts/
# (build-company-registry, build-historical-distress-cohort, probe-eligibility,
# validate-reciprocity). Grep-verified: NO deployed function (api/ + lib/) and
# NO page/browser-js (*.html + assets/js) reads them. Excluding them from the
# deploy shrinks every function bundle ~229MB -> ~122MB (includeFiles stays the
# short proven-good wildcard; Vercel caps that field at 256 chars). Files stay
# in the repo so the local build scripts still work. Reversible: delete these.
# NOTE: portal-registry.json is deliberately NOT here — portal-router.js fetches
# it as a live browser fallback on 250+ portal pages.
